"[MediaSource] Match GOP keyframe PTS in FreeBuffers()" (crbug 577402416;
no CVE listed yet): evicting a merged GOP that shared the last-appended
GOP's timestamps desynchronised SourceBufferStream's append state, so a
later split and non-keyframe append could create a keyframe-less
SourceBufferRange. chromium/src main commit
807547c7e98e0e82c5e074210adf92b65d33b89e, merged on 2026-10-31 to 158 and to
157 as 7c5b52579205a69b15f50263cf85c70c1162c6ed (after the 157.0.8103.34
tag). This is the 157 merge, without its tests. Drop it once a 157 tag has
it.

